  "description": "A comfortable and relaxing ride is what the LXI Flow 1 is all about. combining a Del Sol Comfort Springer saddle together with a suspension seat post and an 80mm rise handlebar will guaranty this. And the lightweight aluminum frame, a Shimano Revo shift 1x8 drivetrain and linear-pull brakes will offer the rider light and efficient performance. Lastly and no less important, a uniquely proper fitting bicycle for most rider heights is achieved through frame sizing and proportionate wheel size. Depending on the frame size that best fits the customer, the bicycle is equipped with either a 26\", 27.5\" or a 29\" wheel size.\nLXI Flow lightweight aluminum frame with Size-Specific Wheel design\nForged Alloy crank arms, steel 38t chainwheel with dual guard\nWide-range 1x7 drivetrain with Shimano Revo twist shifter\nDel Sol Comfort Springer saddle with suspension seat post\nAlloy double wall rims with stainless steel spokes and Kenda Kwick Journey tires",
